    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Slums into Sanctuaries, One Bubble at a Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of <strong>satisfying transformation</strong>\u2014where dirt vanishes, trash explodes, and every space you touch becomes pristine. Welcome to <strong>CleanTwin</strong>, a <strong>casual first-person cleaning adventure</strong> where you wield a powerful bubble gun to <strong>blast grime, destroy clutter, and restore messy environments</strong>. No stress. No enemies. No timer\u2014Just the <strong>pure, relaxing joy</strong> of tidying up at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/79159937c4f02748b558aa57c2cd3658.poster.avif?t=1750816372\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/79159937c4f02748b558aa57c2cd3658.webm?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/79159937c4f02748b558aa57c2cd3658.mp4?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blast the Trash, Pop the Grime!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with the <strong>Bluegun</strong>, a powerful cleaning tool designed to scrub away filth and <strong>obliterate junk</strong>. Fire bubbles to <strong>wash walls, furniture, and floors</strong>, or <strong>shatter clutter into satisfying particles</strong>. Every cleaning action earns <strong>experience points</strong>, allowing you to unlock upgrades that make your tools even more effective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/e4e64814b2b8802ddd58c838c279ceb4.poster.avif?t=1750816372\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/e4e64814b2b8802ddd58c838c279ceb4.webm?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/e4e64814b2b8802ddd58c838c279ceb4.mp4?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tools</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning has never felt this rewarding! Earn XP to level up and unlock <strong>15 powerful upgrades</strong> across three categories:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guns</strong> \u2013 Improve fire rate, range, and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubbles</strong> \u2013 Boost splash size and bubble bounce mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splashes</strong> \u2013 Enhance special paint effects for better movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/991d0634777a176b930a7dcb5950c3a8.poster.avif?t=1750816372\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/991d0634777a176b930a7dcb5950c3a8.webm?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose upgrades that match your playstyle with <strong>five unique skill paths</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength (Red):</strong> Increase splash power, damage, and vaulting grip. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed (Yellow):</strong> Fire faster, move quicker, and dash further. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endurance (Green):</strong> Expand ammo, make bubbles bounce, and enhance jumps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wisdom (Blue):</strong> Extend range, improve accuracy, and gain bonus XP. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luck (Violet):</strong> Increase critical splash chances and slow time effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/2f3273ca46e59349574af85d4c29e44e.poster.avif?t=1750816372\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/2f3273ca46e59349574af85d4c29e44e.webm?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/2f3273ca46e59349574af85d4c29e44e.mp4?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint Your Way \u2013 Creative Parkour Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond cleaning, unlock <strong>paint-powered mobility tools</strong> to <strong>move through tricky spaces with style</strong>. Use special paint splats to <strong>vault, slide, speed up, jump higher, or even stick to walls! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splats <strong>fade naturally over time</strong> or can be <strong>erased instantly</strong> with the Bluegun to <strong>keep your workspace tidy</strong>. Paint guns are <strong>optional</strong>, but they make your <strong>cleaning journey even more dynamic and fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/d465722a7df53d930ac58cfa0a7d367d.poster.avif?t=1750816372\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/d465722a7df53d930ac58cfa0a7d367d.webm?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/d465722a7df53d930ac58cfa0a7d367d.mp4?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect from CleanTwin:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong> \u2013 No timers, no enemies, no stress\u2014just pure cleaning fun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewarding Progression</strong> \u2013 Gain XP, level up, and <strong>unlock meaningful upgrades</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Exploration</strong> \u2013 Use <strong>paint-powered movement tools</strong> to navigate freely. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Visuals</strong> \u2013 A <strong>vibrant, low-poly world</strong> full of <strong>satisfying transformations</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hub-Based Levels</strong> \u2013 Start from a cozy central hub and <strong>restore messy locations</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Feedback</strong> \u2013 <strong>Rich visual &amp; audio cues</strong> enhance the joy of cleaning. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sense of Accomplishment</strong> \u2013 Watch <strong>before-and-after transformations</strong> unfold in real-time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/4a6993ae603013db65717d56dc139452.poster.avif?t=1750816372\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/4a6993ae603013db65717d56dc139452.webm?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351490/extras/4a6993ae603013db65717d56dc139452.mp4?t=1750816372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
